OL,3,GNEWSALabour's Lucy Powell questioned on
OL,4,Acouncil reforms, new GCSEs and small
OL,5,Aboats on BBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour's deputy leader Lucy Powell has
OL,8,Fdone a series of quick-fire interviews
OL,9,Fon seven BBC local radio stations
OL,11,FHer party is preparing to host its
OL,12,Fautumn conference in Liverpool from
OL,13,FSunday
OL,15,FBBC Hereford & Worcester pushed Powell
OL,16,Fover the delay in plans to restructure
OL,17,Flocal councils, and BBC Radio Newcastle
OL,18,Fquizzed the education secretary on GCSE
OL,19,Freforms
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
