OL,3,GNEWSALabour's Lucy Powell questioned on
OL,4,Acouncil reforms, new GCSEs and small
OL,5,Aboats on BBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FBBC Radio Kent, whose patch includes
OL,8,Fthe port of Dover, focused on the issue
OL,9,Fof small boat arrivals while BBC Radio
OL,10,FLeicester challenged her on the cost of
OL,11,Fliving
OL,13,FBBC Radio Cornwall asked about
OL,14,Fdevolution, BBC Radio Solent also
OL,15,Fpressed on small boats and BBC Radio
OL,16,FShropshire focused on powers for rural
OL,17,Fareas
OL,19,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,20,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,21,Fyears. Other party leaders are getting
OL,22,Fa similar opportunity
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
